lass=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a> → <a href=\"./MPN64/Gcd.html#MPN.W64.WMat\">MPN.W64.WMat</a></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./MPN64/Gcd.html#MPN.W64.WMat.mk","kind":"ctor","line":151,"name":"MPN.W64.WMat.mk","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN64/Gcd.lean#L151-L157"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">structure</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN64/Gcd.html#MPN.W64.WMat\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W64</span>.<span class=\"name\">WMat</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A `2 × 2` matrix of words below `2⁶²`, and the sign of its determinant, with unboxed fields.","docLink":"./MPN64/Gcd.html#MPN.W64.WMat","kind":"structure","line":151,"name":"MPN.W64.WMat","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN64/Gcd.lean#L151-L157"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN64/Gcd.html#MPN.W64.cofactors2\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W64</span>.<span class=\"name\">cofactors2</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">y</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt64/Basic.html#ScalarArray.UInt64Array\">ScalarArray.UInt64Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordGcd.html#MPN.Cofactors\">Cofactors</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The cofactors of two runs of Lehmer's steps, like GMP's `hgcd2`: the first on the leading 62\nbits, applied to the leading 128 bits of both numbers, then the second on the leading 62 bits of\nthose, and their product, with cofactors below `2⁶²`. Nothing is proved about them: `applyCof`\nchecks them.","docLink":"./MPN64/Gcd.html#MPN.W64.cofactors2","kind":"def","line":129,"name":"MPN.W64.cofactors2","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN64/Gcd.lean#L129-L149"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN64/Gcd.html#MPN.W64.leadWords\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W64</span>.<span class=\"name\">leadWords</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt64/Basic.html#ScalarArray.UInt64Array\">ScalarArray.UInt64Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordGcd.html#MPN.LeadWords\">LeadWords</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The leading 62 bits of `a`, from its top nonzero limb, and the bits of `b` at the same positions,\nas the words of Lehmer's algorithm. Their values only affect its speed.","docLink":"./MPN64/Gcd.html#MPN.W64.leadWords","kind":"def","line":39,"name":"MPN.W64.leadWords","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN64/Gcd.lean#L39-L49"}}],"imports":["Init","MPN.Generic.HGCD","MPN.LehmerStep","MPN.WordGcd","MPN64.Arch.LinComb","MPN64.Generic.Ops64"],"instances":[{"className":"MPN.LehmerOps","name":"MPN.W64.lehmer64","typeNames":["ScalarArray.UInt64Array","UInt64"]}],"name":"MPN64.Gcd"}